{"text":"Oklahoma died in the notorious Sosa Liso plane crash in Nigeria in December of 2005, almost exactly seven years ago. Oklahoma was the person I could argue with, laugh with, and truly talk to. He was also the first person to call me a feminist. I was about 14. We were in his house arguing, both of us bristling with half-baked knowledge from books that we had read. I don't remember what this particular argument was about, but I remember that as I argued and argued, Oklahoma looked at me and said, you know, you're a feminist. It was not a compliment. I could tell from his tone, the same tone that you would use to say something like, you're a supporter of terrorism. I did not know exactly what this word feminist meant, and I did not want Oklahoma to know that I did not know. So I brushed it aside and I continued to argue. And the first thing I planned to do when I got home was to look up the word feminist in the dictionary.","words":[{"text":"Oklahoma","start":0.82,"end":1.34},{"text":"died","start":1.34,"end":1.66},{"text":"in","start":1.66,"end":1.86},{"text":"the","start":1.86,"end":1.94},{"text":"notorious","start":1.94,"end":2.5},{"text":"Sosa","start":2.5,"end":3.22},{"text":"Liso","start":3.22,"end":3.54},{"text":"plane","start":3.54,"end":3.78},{"text":"crash","start":3.78,"end":4.24},{"text":"in","start":4.24,"end":5.1},{"text":"Nigeria","start":5.1,"end":5.42},{"text":"in","start":5.42,"end":5.76},{"text":"December","start":5.76,"end":5.9},{"text":"of","start":5.9,"end":6.1},{"text":"2005","start":6.1,"end":6.9,"punct":","},{"text":"almost","start":7.64,"end":8.24},{"text":"exactly","start":8.24,"end":8.68},{"text":"seven","start":8.68,"end":9.0},{"text":"years","start":9.0,"end":9.26},{"text":"ago","start":9.26,"end":9.58,"punct":"."},{"text":"Oklahoma","start":11.08,"end":11.28},{"text":"was","start":11.28,"end":11.48},{"text":"the","start":11.48,"end":11.58},{"text":"person","start":11.58,"end":11.76},{"text":"I","start":11.76,"end":11.92},{"text":